# format -> css-manifest map for NEW-SYSTEM (data-mx) issues (WP-3).
# stitch-issue.sh normalises the plan's format (underscores -> hyphens) and
# looks it up here; <manifest> means references/css-manifests/<manifest>.txt.
# Legacy formats/issues (no design_system:"mx" in the plan) never consult this
# file — they keep the shipped glob pipeline untouched.
#
# format          manifest   motion-tier-default
deep-dive         editorial  tier0
rewind            editorial  tier1
versus            editorial  tier2
guide             editorial  tier1
next              editorial  tier1
season-review     event      tier2
countdown         event      tier2
field-guide       event      tier2
